"Choose how to filter content for gallery processing and specify which "
"pages, posts, or selectors to include or exclude."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite kako filtrirati sadržaj za obradu galerije i navedite koje "
"stranice, objave ili odabira uključiti ili isključiti."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3222
msgid "Processing Mode"
msgstr "Način obrade"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3225
msgid "Process all content EXCEPT the items specified below"
msgstr "Obradite sav sadržaj OSIM stavki navedenih u nastavku"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3228
msgid "ONLY process the items specified below"
msgstr "OBRADITE SAMO stavke navedene u nastavku"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3235
msgid "Inclusion Mode"
msgstr "Način uključivanja"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3239
msgid "Exclusion Mode"
msgstr "Način isključivanja"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3259
msgid "Images in post content"
msgstr "Slike u sadržaju objave"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3260
msgid ""
"When enabled, individual images without links and \"Enlarge to Click\" set "
"in posts and pages will automatically open in the gallery."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, pojedinačne slike bez veza i \"Povećaj za klik\" "
"postavljene u objavama i stranicama automatski će se otvoriti u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3276
msgid "Images and videos in widgets and sidebars"
msgstr "Slike i videozapisi u widgetima i bočnim trakama"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3277
msgid ""
"When enabled, images and videos in widget areas will automatically open in "
"the gallery."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, slike i videozapisi u područjima widgeta automatski će "
"se otvoriti u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3293
msgid "Gallery shortcodes and blocks"
msgstr "Galerija kratkih kodova i blokova"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3294
msgid ""
"When enabled, images in WordPress [gallery] shortcodes and Gutenberg "
"Gallery blocks will automatically open in the gallery window."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, slike u WordPress [gallery] kratkim kodovima i Gutenberg "
"Gallery blokovima automatski će se otvoriti u prozoru galerije."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3310
msgid "Featured images"
msgstr "Istaknute slike"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3311
msgid ""
"When enabled, featured images (post thumbnails) will automatically open in "
"the gallery when clicked."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, istaknute slike (mini slike objava) automatski će se "
"otvoriti u galeriji kada se klikne."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3320
msgid ""
"Automatically open all MetaSlider slideshows in the gallery, overriding the "
"per-slider setting."
msgstr ""
"Automatski otvorite sve MetaSlider prezentacije u galeriji, ignorirajući "
"postavku po prezentaciji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3334
msgid "MetaSlider slideshows"
msgstr "MetaSlider prezentacije"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3335
msgid ""
"When enabled, all MetaSlider slideshows will open slides in the gallery "
"window, overriding the per-slider setting."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, sve MetaSlider prezentacije otvorit će slajdove u "
"prozoru galerije, ignorirajući postavku po prezentaciji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3351
msgid "Videos in post content"
msgstr "Videozapisi u sadržaju objave"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3352
msgid ""
"When enabled, standalone video blocks (HTML5 videos, YouTube embeds, Vimeo "
"embeds) in post/page content will automatically open in the gallery."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, samostalni video blokovi (HTML5 video, YouTube umetci, "
"Vimeo umetci) u sadržaju objave/stranice automatski će se otvoriti u "
"galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3387
msgid ""
"Background color for the gallery overlay. Dark colors work best for image "
"viewing."
msgstr ""
"Boja pozadine za preklapanje galerije. Tamne boje najbolje odgovaraju "
"gledanju slika."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3392
msgid ""
"Background color for \"Open in Gallery\" buttons that appear on slides, "
"images and videos."
msgstr ""
"Boja pozadine za \"Otvori u galeriji\" gumbe koji se pojavljuju na "
"slajdovima, slikama i videozapisima."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3397
msgid ""
"Text color for \"Open in Gallery\" buttons that appear on slides, images "
"and videos."
msgstr ""
"Boja teksta za \"Otvori u galeriji\" gumbe koji se pojavljuju na "
"slajdovima, slikama i videozapisima."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3402
msgid "Background color when hovering over \"Open in Gallery\" buttons."
msgstr "Boja pozadine pri prelasku mišem preko \"Otvori u galeriji\" gumba."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3407
msgid "Text color when hovering over \"Open in Gallery\" buttons."
msgstr "Boja teksta pri prelasku mišem preko \"Otvori u galeriji\" gumba."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3420
msgid ""
"Custom text for gallery buttons. This text will appear on all \"Open in "
"Gallery\" buttons throughout the site."
msgstr ""
"Prilagođeni tekst za gumbe u galeriji. Ovaj tekst će se pojaviti na svim "
"\"Otvori u galeriji\" gumbima širom stranice."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3433 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3459
msgid "Top Right (Default)"
msgstr "Gore desno (zadano)"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3446
msgid "Choose where to position the close button (X) in the gallery overlay."
msgstr "Odaberite gdje postaviti gumb za zatvaranje (X) u preklapanju galerije."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3472
msgid ""
"Choose where to position \"Open in Gallery\" buttons within slides, images, "
"galleries, and videos."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite gdje postaviti \"Otvori u galeriji\" gumbe unutar slajdova, "
"slika, galerija i videozapisa."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3477
msgid "Color for previous and next navigation arrows in the gallery."
msgstr "Boja za prethodne i sljedeće navigacijske strelice u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3482
msgid ""
"Arrow color when hovering. Creates visual feedback when users move their "
"mouse over the navigation arrows."
msgstr ""
"Boja strelice pri prelasku. Stvara vizualnu povratnu informaciju kada "
"korisnici pomiču miš preko navigacijskih strelica."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3487
msgid "Color for the close button (X) in the gallery."
msgstr "Boja za gumb za zatvaranje (X) u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3492
msgid ""
"Close button color when hovering. Creates visual feedback when users move "
"their mouse over the close button."
msgstr ""
"Boja gumba za zatvaranje pri prelaženju mišem. Stvara vizualnu povratnu "
"informaciju kada korisnici presele miš iznad gumba za zatvaranje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3497
msgid ""
"Color for toolbar icons and counter text in the lightbox. Affects zoom, "
"fullscreen icons (Pro), and image counter display."
msgstr ""
"Boja za ikone alatne trake i tekst brojača u lightboxu. Utječe na ikone "
"zumiranja, ikone za cijeli ekran (Pro) i prikaz broja slika."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3502
msgid ""
"Toolbar icon color when hovering. Creates visual feedback when users move "
"their mouse over toolbar icons and counter."
msgstr ""
"Boja ikona alatne trake pri prelaženju mišem. Stvara vizualnu povratnu "
"informaciju kada korisnici presele miš iznad ikona alatne trake i brojača."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3507
msgid "Background color for previous and next navigation arrow buttons."
msgstr "Boja pozadine za gumbe navigacije prethodni i sljedeći."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3512
msgid ""
"Background color for arrow buttons when hovering. Creates visual feedback "
"when users move their mouse over the arrows."
msgstr ""
"Boja pozadine za gumbe sa strelicama pri prelaženju mišem. Stvara vizualnu "
"povratnu informaciju kada korisnici presele miš iznad strelica."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3517
msgid "Background color for the close button (X) in the gallery."
msgstr "Boja pozadine za gumb za zatvaranje (X) u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3522
msgid ""
"Background color for the close button when hovering. Creates visual "
"feedback when users move their mouse over the close button."
msgstr ""
"Boja pozadine za gumb za zatvaranje pri prelaženju mišem. Stvara vizualnu "
"povratnu informaciju kada korisnici presele miš iznad gumba za zatvaranje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3527
msgid "Background color for toolbar icons in the lightbox."
msgstr "Boja pozadine za ikone alatne trake u lightboxu."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3532
msgid ""
"Background color for toolbar icons when hovering. Creates visual feedback "
"when users move their mouse over toolbar icons."
msgstr ""
"Boja pozadine za ikone alatne trake pri prelaženju mišem. Stvara vizualnu "
"povratnu informaciju kada korisnici presele miš iznad ikona alatne trake."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3577 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3590
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3603 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3701
msgid "Icon Hover"
msgstr "Ikona pri prelaženju"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3578 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3591
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3604 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3685
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3702
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Pozadina"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3579 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3592
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3605 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3686
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3703
msgid "Background Hover"
msgstr "Pozadina pri prelaženju"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3622
msgid "Set the opacity of the gallery background (0 = transparent, 1 = opaque)."
msgstr "Postavite prozirnost pozadine galerije (0 = prozirno, 1 = neprozirno)."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3631
msgid "Color of the progress bar shown during autoplay slideshows."
msgstr "Boja trake napretka prikazane tijekom automatskih slideshow-a."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3637
msgid "Border"
msgstr "Granica"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3638
msgid "Border Active and Hover"
msgstr "Aktivna granica i granica pri prelaženju"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3650
msgid "Show navigation arrows in gallery"
msgstr "Prikaži navigacijske strelice u galeriji"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3651
msgid ""
"Display left/right arrows for navigation. Also enables keyboard navigation "
"(← → keys, ESC to close). This is available for slideshows and image "
"galleries."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži lijeve/desne strelice za navigaciju. Također omogućuje navigaciju "
"tipkovnicom (← → tipke, ESC za zatvaranje). Ovo je dostupno za slideshow-e "
"i galerije slika."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3660
msgid "Customize the gallery background and overlay appearance."
msgstr "Prilagodite pozadinu galerije i izgled preklopa."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3665
msgid "Customize navigation icons (close, previous, next arrows) for gallery."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite ikone navigacije (zatvori, prethodne, sljedeće strelice) za "
"galeriju."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3670
msgid ""
"Customize the \"Open in Gallery\" buttons that can be added to slides, "
"images, galleries, and videos."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite gumbe \"Otvorite u galeriji\" koji se mogu dodati na slajdove, "
"slike, galerije i videozapise."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3683
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3684
msgid "Text Hover"
msgstr "Tekst na pregledu"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3709
msgid ""
"Configure navigation and control options that apply to all MetaSlider "
"galleries."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte opcije navigacije i kontrole koje se primjenjuju na sve "
"MetaSlider galerije."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3714
msgid "Help search engines understand the images in your galleries."
msgstr "Pomoćite tražilicama da razumiju slike u vašim galerijama."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3725
msgid "Output SEO structured data for galleries"
msgstr "Izlazni SEO strukturirani podaci za galerije"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3726
msgid ""
"Adds Schema.org ImageGallery markup so search engines can index your "
"gallery images. Turn this off if your SEO plugin already outputs gallery "
"structured data."
msgstr ""
"Dodaje Schema.org markup za ImageGallery kako bi ga tražilice mogle "
"indeksirati. Isključite ovo ako vaš SEO dodatak već izlazi s strukturiranim "
"podacima galerije."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3733
msgid "Hear about new features and security releases for MetaSlider Gallery."
msgstr "Saznajte o novim značajkama i sigurnosnim izdanjima za MetaSlider Gallery."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3745
msgid "Email me about updates"
msgstr "Pošaljite mi email o ažuriranjima"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3747
msgid ""
"Occasional emails about new features and security releases. Unsubscribe at "
"any time."
msgstr ""
"Povremeni emailovi o novim značajkama i sigurnosnim izdanjima. Odjavite se "
"u bilo kojem trenutku."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3759, fuzzy
msgid "you@example.com"
msgstr "you@example.com"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3805
msgid "Please enter a valid email address to receive updates."
msgstr "Molimo unesite valjanu email adresu za primanje ažuriranja."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3829
msgid "You are subscribed. Check your inbox to confirm."
msgstr "Pretplaćeni ste. Provjerite svoju pristiglu poštu za potvrdu."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3840
msgid ""
"Your preference was saved, but we could not add your address to the mailing "
"list. Please check it and save again."
msgstr ""
"Vaša preferencija je spremljena, ali nismo mogli dodati vašu adresu na "
"popis za slanje. Molimo provjerite je i ponovno spremite."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3854
msgid "Show thumbnails"
msgstr "Prikaži sličice"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3855
msgid ""
"Display thumbnail images at the bottom of the gallery for easy navigation. "
"This is available for slideshows and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Prikazivanje sličica na dnu galerije za lakšu navigaciju. Ovo je dostupno "
"za slajdove i galerije slika."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3868
msgid "How visitors open images"
msgstr "Kako posjetitelji otvaraju slike"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3889
msgid "Show captions"
msgstr "Prikaži natpise"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3890
msgid ""
"When enabled, display captions in the gallery window. This is available for "
"slideshows, images, and image galleries."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, prikazuje natpise u prozoru galerije. Ovo je dostupno za "
"slajdove, slike i galerije slika."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3897
msgid "Advanced lightbox features are available through MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr "Napredne značajke lightboxa dostupne su putem MetaSlider Gallery Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3899
msgid "Get a preview of the advanced features available in MetaSlider Gallery Pro."
msgstr "Pogledajte pregled naprednih značajki dostupnih u MetaSlider Gallery Pro."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3902
msgid ""
"These advanced LightGallery.js plugins are available in the Pro version "
"with additional customization options."
msgstr ""
"Ovi napredni LightGallery.js dodaci dostupni su u Pro verziji s dodatnim "
"opcijama prilagodbe."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3930 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3931
msgid "specific Pages"
msgstr "specifične stranice"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3933
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite stranice na kojima bi galerija trebala biti onemogućena. "
"Prikazuje do 100 najnovijih stranica. Upisujte za pretraživanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3933 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3934
msgid ""
"Select pages where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"pages. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite stranice na kojima bi galerija trebala biti omogućena. Prikazuje "
"do 100 najnovijih stranica. Upisujte za pretraživanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3978 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3979
msgid "specific Posts"
msgstr "specifične objave"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3981
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be disabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite objave u kojima bi galerija trebala biti onemogućena. Prikazuje "
"do 100 najnovijih objava. Upisujte za pretraživanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3981 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3982
msgid ""
"Select posts where gallery should be enabled. Shows up to 100 most recent "
"posts. Type to search."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite objave u kojima bi galerija trebala biti omogućena. Prikazuje do "
"100 najnovijih objava. Upisujte za pretraživanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4009
msgid "include"
msgstr "uključi"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4009
msgid "exclude"
msgstr "izostavi"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4049
#, php-format
msgid "specific %s"
msgstr "specifični %s"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4050
#, php-format
msgid "%s specific %s"
msgstr "%s specifični %s"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4052 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4053
#, php-format
msgid "Shows up to 100 most recent %s. Type to search."
msgstr "Prikazuje do 100 najnovijih %s. Upisujte za pretraživanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4101 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4102
msgid "specific post types"
msgstr "specifične vrste objava"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4104
msgid "Select post types where gallery should be disabled entirely."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite vrste objava u kojima bi galerija trebala biti potpuno "
"onemogućena."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4104 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4105
msgid "Select post types where gallery should be enabled entirely."
msgstr "Odaberite vrste objava u kojima bi galerija trebala biti potpuno omogućena."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4139
msgid "Exclude by CSS selector"
msgstr "Izostavi prema CSS selektoru"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4142
msgid ""
"CSS selectors for elements to exclude from gallery window (one per line). "
"Examples:<br>.no-lightbox<br>.custom-gallery img<br>#sidebar .widget-area"
msgstr ""
"CSS selektori za elemente koje treba izostaviti iz prozora galerije (jedan "
"po liniji). Primjeri:<br>.no-lightbox<br>.custom-gallery img<br>#sidebar "
".widget-area"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4165
msgid "Minimum Image Width"
msgstr "Minimalna širina slike"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4168
msgid ""
"Skip images narrower than this width (in pixels). Uses the displayed width, "
"not the actual image file size. This is helpful for excluding small icons, "
"badges, and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Preskoči slike užih od ove širine (u pikselima). Koristi prikazanu širinu, "
"a ne stvarnu veličinu datoteke slike. Ovo je korisno za izostavljanje malih "
"ikona, oznaka i dugmadi."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4191
msgid "Minimum Image Height"
msgstr "Minimalna visina slike"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4194
msgid ""
"Skip images shorter than this height (in pixels). Uses the displayed "
"height, not the actual image file size. This is helpful for excluding small "
"icons, badges, and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Preskoči slike kraće od ove visine (u pikselima). Koristi prikazanu visinu, "
"a ne stvarnu veličinu datoteke slike. Ovo je korisno za izostavljanje malih "
"ikona, oznaka i dugmadi."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4210 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4367
msgid ""
"Enhanced media handling and video playback features for professional "
"galleries."
msgstr ""
"Poboljšano rukovanje medijima i značajke reprodukcije video sadržaja za "
"profesionalne galerije."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4217
msgid "Advanced features for professional lightbox implementations."
msgstr "Napredne značajke za profesionalne implementacije lightbox-a."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4228 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4440
msgid "Enable Zoom"
msgstr "Omogući zumiranje"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4229
msgid ""
"Double-click to zoom, zoom controls, mouse wheel zoom, and zoom-to-fit "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Dvostruki klik za zumiranje, kontrole zumiranja, zumiranje pomoću kotačića "
"miša i opcije zumiranja za prilagodbu."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4239 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4447
msgid "Enable Fullscreen"
msgstr "Omogući cijeli ekran"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4240
msgid ""
"Native HTML5 fullscreen support with keyboard shortcuts (F key) for "
"immersive viewing."
msgstr ""
"Izvorna HTML5 podrška za cijeli ekran s prečacima na tipkovnici (tipka F) "
"za uranjajuće gledanje."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4250 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4454
msgid "Enable Rotate"
msgstr "Omogući rotaciju"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4251
msgid ""
"Rotate images clockwise/anticlockwise, flip horizontal/vertical with "
"toolbar controls."
msgstr ""
"Rotiraj slike u smjeru kazaljke na satu/protiv smjera kazaljke na satu, "
"preokreni horizontalno/vertikalno s kontrolama na alatnoj traci."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4261
msgid "Enable Video"
msgstr "Omogući video"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4262
msgid ""
"Enhanced video support for YouTube, Vimeo, HTML5 videos with autoplay and "
"quality controls."
msgstr ""
"Poboljšana podrška za video za YouTube, Vimeo i HTML5 video s automatskim "
"reprodukcijama i kontrolama kvalitete."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4272 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4489
#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4644
msgid "Enable Unique Image URLs"
msgstr "Omogući jedinstvene URL-ove slika"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4273
msgid ""
"Unique URLs for each gallery image with browser back/forward navigation "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Jedinstveni URL-ovi za svaku sliku u galeriji s podrškom za navigaciju "
"unazad/naprijed u pregledniku."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4283 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4496
msgid "Enable Autoplay"
msgstr "Omogući automatsku reprodukciju"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4284
msgid "Automatically advance through images in the gallery."
msgstr "Automatski prelaz kroz slike u galeriji."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4294 class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4468
msgid "Enable Share"
msgstr "Omogući dijeljenje"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:4295
msgid ""
"Social media sharing buttons for Facebook, Twitter, Pinterest, and direct "
"URL sharing."
msgstr ""
